# Editor UI

- Vue 3 `<script setup lang="ts">`. Props and emits are typed.
- User-visible copy goes through `useI18n().baseText('key')`. Add the English string in `packages/frontend/@n8n/i18n/src/locales/en.json`.
- `data-testid` is one value, with no spaces.
- Style with semantic tokens from `@n8n/design-system/src/css/_tokens.scss` or `_primitives.scss`. Do not use `_tokens.legacy.scss` or raw px spacing.
- Reuse `@n8n/design-system` components. Icon names come from `updatedIconSet` in `packages/frontend/@n8n/design-system/src/components/N8nIcon/icons.ts`.
- Debounce with `getDebounceTime` from `@/app/constants`, not a magic number.
- Inside `N8nDialog`, keep Element Plus popovers in the dialog stack with `:teleported="false"` unless they must escape it.

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { useI18n } from '@n8n/i18n';

defineProps<{ titleKey: string }>();
const i18n = useI18n();
</script>

<template>
  <span data-testid="workflow-title">{{ i18n.baseText(titleKey) }}</span>
</template>
```

Read `packages/frontend/AGENTS.md` and the design-system skill before changing layout or visual design.
